{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0fada0e8b47bea460c653f71b2fc008a5605ad6b737b5fe18215bc3beab3a57d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c00c276a5d282249af387516fccc6f5403b348baa28e70866416b7f6200bbb81"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"Tig is described as an autonomous AI coding agent that runs in the terminal, comparable to Claude Code and OpenAI Codex but supporting more LLMs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_399928b6fa686a1f334fd141b4ac87ed933874f4852a645f7046c54d59869faa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_005e1a1d73b8ef30fca020077ca365a4d5d4a1faca8b3a56b37d137ef3e5f450","slc_b50e3a432d309cdb654efba23e1244d7e6c00399cd58b12301eb27bf1f2a28d5"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"The agent can write code, fix bugs, execute shell commands, write tests, and analyze a codebase, all within the terminal.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_57924eb2a964f8b30b16883683ae0766eaad0101bfb6fcb9dd247153518924a0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_70ab7af4fc46ac667eb80add1bd91d4f91b04e168944197d20e41248b2b6ba33","slc_e80f36a43ce47c6a48975e4ea24873ba494eba473891ae712ac922f6c2af4505"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"Tig is installed via pip as the tig-code package and run with the tig command, optionally with a --mode flag choosing code or architect.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8e8a405f9ca3d8568fd4bb348b0946c5f1ae032ef75fb02c35d8b064b1ca8b05","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9e66339bb387806cc8150a7795fb0133ff32eb29c44588d1e9bd429c2419792f"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"Tig offers task modes: an Architect mode that designs systems and saves designs to a markdown file, and a Code mode that implements the architect's plan step by step.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a4b342a90d9afa0ed9b1ce7c55b254e8b0c94433887c8b65519fda02f3638332","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_15e00816373205b5b6b2c4bdb48fa92765711c6d1aa11f8b83e669e0e27650d0","slc_368ea650dea2a548906d5487d6476bd20a88a6637b8cea1138b477a3171b71da","slc_5f998f96ffa23c371074e1f6d2efe035f81555aeaac954e6ec691a872bcef395","slc_a6a0085d84025fbd9eece7a804c40ee6f3aeb5e174b85974c1dcc5eb2460a02b","slc_c977d7b0329d4b54f85dddf8ff7dc64118139c2c32d832fe65bec69e10076313"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"Ripgrep is listed as an external tool Tig depends on, with per-OS install instructions (Homebrew on macOS, pacman on Arch, dnf on Fedora).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ae4bcf922f5e37a2ef0bea586f175f7bf7add26e6c13afc06f54760c8af663ed","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a884780cf7688d09e02bc5fee062ada8168d547e01d4c3c9d6ea9ac376fc7888"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"Supported LLM providers include Google Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, OpenRouter, Deepseek, Groq, and local models via Ollama.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c2a870957dfc98a6628a68aec3082a1dd109a5b5442d45672bd9b549f1a4b365","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2227a654b047e23e5cbe2f6d2b3ee61a8819a192a4afeeec3fc9c57c464b8f2d","slc_f63c5814b6f684a8aa55cbd9d98f6cc30ea16c77bca9fbf6c37eba0cf9fc3aa3"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"Configuration is done through a .env file specifying the provider (google, openai, anthropic, deepseek, groq, ollama, openrouter), model (e.g. TIG_MODEL), and the matching provider API key.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d8a96cf9f697b9e0daed31bb07f70e8f37ddea9f0cd372fe129a287c12b0d932","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"rsrohan99/tig@3df12189c01e snapshot ebda47659608a8ec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e80f36a43ce47c6a48975e4ea24873ba494eba473891ae712ac922f6c2af4505"],"source_ids":["src_943392479c4c58a18175c7031ad2563e"],"text":"By default Tig's file read/write/update actions appear to require approval; a --auto-approve flag lets users auto-approve all actions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd877ed173204a6590b5e3ea5655dd53"}
